{"step_index":110,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-29T23:59:47Z","thinking":"**Constructing Admin.jsx**\n\nI'm now integrating the head and tail of `Admin.jsx` to form the complete file. I have successfully included necessary imports, like `useState` from React and components such as `Navbar`. Further, I've incorporated context providers and mock data for initial setup and styling using the CSS file.\n\n\n**Implementing Form Functionality**\n\nI'm now implementing the form logic within `Admin.jsx`. I've set up initial state including an empty form object, and states to manage form visibility and editing. I have also established handlers for input changes, form submission, edit actions, delete actions, and cancellation of form actions. Furthermore, the submission handler now incorporates update or add actions depending on whether the record is being edited. The delete handler now confirms the delete action.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import { useState } from \"react\";\nimport Navbar from \"../components/Navbar/Navbar\";\nimport { useDailyOptions } from \"../contexts/DailyOptionsContext\";\nimport { meals, currentUser } from \"../data/mockData\";\nimport \"./Admin.css\";\n\nconst emptyForm = { name: \"\", description: \"\", price: \"\", image: \"\" };\n\nfunction Admin() {\n  const { options: dailyOptions, addOption, updateOption, removeOption } =\n    useDailyOptions();\n  const [showForm, setShowForm] = useState(false);\n  const [editingId, setEditingId] = useState(null);\n  const [form, setForm] = useState(emptyForm);\n\n  const totalMeals = meals.length;\n  const availableMeals = meals.filter((m) => m.available).length;\n\n  const handleChange = (e) => {\n    setForm({ ...form, [e.target.name]: e.target.value });\n  };\n\n  const handleSubmit = (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (!form.name || !form.price) return;\n\n    const payload = {\n      name: form.name,\n      description: form.description,\n      price: Number(form.price),\n      image:\n        form.image ||\n        \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546069901-ba9599a7e63c?w=400&h=300&fit=crop\",\n    };\n\n    if (editingId) {\n      updateOption(editingId, payload);\n    } else {\n      addOption(payload);\n    }\n\n    setForm(emptyForm);\n    setEditingId(null);\n    setShowForm(false);\n  };\n\n  const handleEdit = (option) => {\n    setForm({\n      name: option.name,\n      description: option.description,\n      price: option.price,\n      image: option.image,\n    });\n    setEditingId(option.id);\n    setShowForm(true);\n  };\n\n  const handleDelete = (id) => {\n    if (window.confirm(\"Remove this daily option?\")) {\n      removeOption(id);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const handleCancel = () => {\n    setForm(emptyForm);\n    setEditingId(null);\n    setShowForm(false);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"page\">\n      <Navbar user={{ ...currentUser, role: \"admin\" }} />\n      <main className=\"admin-page\">\n        <div className=\"admin-container\">\n          <div className=\"admin-header\">\n            <h1>Admin Dashboard</h1>\n            <p>Manage meals, daily options, and menu settings</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"admin-stats\">\n            <div className=\"stat-card\">\n              <span className=\"stat-number\">{dailyOptions.length}</span>\n              <span className=\"stat-label\">Daily Options</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"stat-card\">\n              <span className=\"stat-number\">{totalMeals}</span>\n              <span className=\"stat-label\">Total Meals</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"stat-card\">\n              <span className=\"stat-number\">{availableMeals}</span>\n              <span className=\"stat-label\">Available</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"stat-card\">\n              <span className=\"stat-number\">3</span>\n              <span className=\"stat-label\">Active Orders</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Daily Options Management */}\n          <section className=\"admin-section\">\n            <div className=\"admin-section-header\">\n              <h2>Daily Options</h2>\n              <button\n                className=\"btn-primary btn-primary--inline\"\n                onClick={() => {\n                  setShowForm(true);\n                  setEditingId(null);\n                  setForm(emptyForm);\n                }}\n              >\n                + Add Option\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n            {showForm && (\n              <form className=\"daily-option-form\" onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n                <h3>{editingId ? \"Edit Daily Option\" : \"New Daily Option\"}</h3>\n                <div className=\"form-grid\">\n                  <div className=\"input-primary\">\n                    <label htmlFor=\"opt-name\">Name</label>\n                    <input\n                      id=\"opt-name\"\n                      name=\"name\"\n                      placeholder=\"e.g. Beef with Rice\"\n                      value={form.name}\n                      onChange={handleChange}\n                      required\n                    />\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"input-primary\">\n                    <label htmlFor=\"opt-price\">Price (KSh)</label>\n                    <input\n                      id=\"opt-price\"\n                      name=\"price\"\n                      type=\"number\"\n                      min=\"0\"\n                      placeholder=\"1050\"\n                      value={form.price}\n                      onChange={handleChange}\n                      required\n                    />\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"input-primary form-grid-full\">\n                    <label htmlFor=\"opt-desc\">Description</label>\n                    <input\n                      id=\"opt-desc\"\n                      name=\"description\"\n                      placeholder=\"Short description of the meal\"\n                      value={form.description}\n                      onChange={handleChange}\n                    />\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"input-primary form-grid-full\">\n                    <label htmlFor=\"opt-image\">Image URL (optional)</label>\n                    <input\n                      id=\"opt-image\"\n                      name=\"image\"\n                      placeholder=\"https://...\"\n                      value={form.image}\n                      onChange={handleChange}\n                    />\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"form-actions\">\n                  <button\n                    type=\"button\"\n                    className=\"btn-cancel\"\n                    onClick={handleCancel}\n                  >\n                    Cancel\n                  </button>\n                  <button type=\"submit\" className=\"btn-save\">\n                    {editingId ? \"Save Changes\" : \"Add Option\"}\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </form>\n            )}\n\n            <div className=\"admin-table\">\n              <div className=\"table-header\">\n       